 "script": [
  {
   "cue": [
    "title"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "小朋友们好！我们的家，就像一棵大树。今天，我们来画一画家族树。"
    },
    {
     "en": "family tree"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "map",
    "show:husband",
    "focus:husband"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "一个男人结婚了，他就是丈夫："
    },
    {
     "en": "husband"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:wife",
    "focus:wife"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "和他结婚的女人，是妻子："
    },
    {
     "en": "wife"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:couple",
    "edge:husband>couple",
    "edge:wife>couple",
    "focus:couple"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "丈夫和妻子在一起，是一对夫妻："
    },
    {
     "en": "couple"
    },
    {
     "zh": "这个词也可以表示一对："
    },
    {
     "en": "a couple of apples"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:parents",
    "edge:couple>parents",
    "focus:parents"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "他们有了孩子，就成了孩子的父母。还记得第二集吗？"
    },
    {
     "en": "parents"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:ancestor",
    "edge:ancestor>parents",
    "focus:ancestor"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "爸爸的爸爸的爸爸……很久很久以前的老祖宗，是祖先："
    },
    {
     "en": "ancestor"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:brother",
    "edge:parents>brother",
    "focus:brother"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "同一对父母的男孩子，是兄弟："
    },
    {
     "en": "brother"
    },
    {
     "en": "my big brother"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:sister",
    "edge:parents>sister",
    "focus:sister"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "女孩子，是姐妹："
    },
    {
     "en": "sister"
    },
    {
     "en": "my little sister"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:twins",
    "edge:brother>twins",
    "edge:sister>twins",
    "focus:twins"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "同一天出生、长得几乎一样的两个孩子，是双胞胎："
    },
    {
     "en": "twins"
    },
    {
     "zh": "还记得第三十一集吗？"
    },
    {
     "en": "They look the same!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:blood",
    "focus:blood"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "家人之间，流着一样的血，这叫血缘："
    },
    {
     "en": "blood"
    },
    {
     "zh": "中间的两个 o，读短短的 a。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:relation",
    "edge:blood>relation",
    "focus:relation"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "家人之间的联系，叫"
    },
    {
     "en": "relation"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:relationship",
    "edge:relation>relationship",
    "focus:relationship"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "在后面加上 s h i p，就是关系："
    },
    {
     "en": "relationship"
    },
    {
     "en": "a good relationship"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:although",
    "focus:although"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "最后学一个小词：虽然。"
    },
    {
     "en": "although"
    },
    {
     "en": "Although we are not twins, we look the same."
